{"success": true, "name": "continual-arc-puzzle-solving", "file": "references/heterogeneous-demo-budget-failure-review.md", "content": "# Session review: task-18868900 (heterogeneous demo stream, repeated retries)

This run exposed a critical stop-gate failure. Eight demonstrations had wildly different lattice geometries, palettes, and output dimensions; no common transformation was established or replayed. Despite that, the agent spent the full demo budget without synthesizing each pair, then submitted several speculative outputs with changing shapes/colors. Some attempts were near-duplicates, including a repeated rejected grid. Binary rejection did not support any of these edits.

